<title>USA: Noble oks $393 mln exploration budget in '97.</title>
<headline>Noble oks $393 mln exploration budget in '97.</headline>
<dateline>ARDMORE, OKLA. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noble Affiliates Inc said it approved an exploration and development budget of $393 million for 1997.</p>
<p>The new budget is 68 percent higher than the 1996 budget, with about two-thirds of it expected to be spent on exploration and development prospects offshore in the Gulf of Mexico, the company said.</p>
<p>Domestic onshore spending comprises about 22 percent of the budget, and international spending about 11 percent, the company added.</p>
</text>
